# Clean page

Positive control. Every claim below is true of this tree.

The acceptance suite is `test/docs-lint.bats`. Run it with `make docs-lint-test`.
The Go case is `TestAcceptanceHealthEndpoint`.
The browser case is `test/acceptance/onboarding.spec.ts`.

Verify a bundle:

```bash
scripts/verify-eap-evidence.sh bundle.tar.gz --require-live
```
